      "text": "Answer each part without a calculator. Let \\( r(x) = \\dfrac{x + 9}{2x^{2} + x - 3} \\), \\( q(x) = \\dfrac{x^{2} + 3x}{x^{2} - 1} \\) and \\( p(x) = \\dfrac{6}{x^{2} + 5x + 6} \\)."
